{
  "schema": "cablesim.plugin/2",
  "id": "cablesim.iec60287",
  "version": "0.7.0",
  "name": "IEC 60287 载流量",
  "description": "计算声明范围内单芯或独立屏蔽三芯直埋、排管与矩形回填的稳态温度和允许电流，输出逐源互热、屏蔽与磁性铠装损耗及核对表。",
  "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
  "publisher": {
    "id": "cablesim",
    "name": "CableSimPro"
  },
  "host_api": {
    "major": 2,
    "min_minor": 1
  },
  "license": {
    "spdx": "LicenseRef-Project-Undeclared",
    "review_required": false
  },
  "platforms": [
    "windows-x64",
    "linux-x64",
    "darwin-arm64",
    "darwin-x64"
  ],
  "runtime": {
    "kind": "python",
    "python": ">=3.11,<3.14",
    "entry": "src/cablesim_iec60287/main.py"
  },
  "permissions": [
    "study.run",
    "artifact.write"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "resources": {
    "timeout_s": 60,
    "memory_mb": 256,
    "network": "none"
  },
  "capabilities": [
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "tb880-wire-foil-rating",
      "title": "TB880 铜丝与铝箔屏蔽参考链",
      "method_version": "cablesim.iec60287.tb880-wire-foil/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.iec60287.tb880-wire-foil/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "ampacity",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.iec60287-reference",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "TB880:2022 Case1 pp131-163; touching trefoil and spaced flat, full primitive-input chains"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "三叶形固接、平排不换位不平衡交叉互联参考结构；两金属层损耗与温度分别迭代。",
        "保留出版物历史公式，不替代IEC2023通用工程计算或审批。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "tb880-reference-rating",
      "title": "TB880 三芯海缆与铜线屏蔽参考链",
      "method_version": "cablesim.iec60287.tb880-reference/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.iec60287.tb880-reference/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "ampacity",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.iec60287-reference",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "TB880:2022 Case2 pp164-179; Case4 pp195-205; primitive SI geometry/material chains"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "仅明确的三芯铅护套钢丝铠装、接触三叶形低覆盖铜线屏蔽两类参考结构。",
        "保留TB880历史公式约定，不替代IEC2023通用工程计算。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "armoured-sl-rating",
      "title": "三芯圆导体钢丝铠装SL热路（IEC 60287-1-1 §5.4）",
      "method_version": "cablesim.iec60287.armour/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.iec60287.armoured-sl/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "ampacity",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.iec60287.loss_factor.armour",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.iec60287.losses.armour",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.iec60287-armour",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "CIGRE TB880 Case 2 §6.6/6.11/6.12, pages174/178/179"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "仅三芯圆导体钢丝铠装SL热路；给定同一温限工作点Rc/Rs/λ1/T1-T4，迭代铠装温度。",
        "非磁性护套并联替代量按§5.4.2实现；完整非磁性λ1/λ2热路未验证，拒算。",
        "不覆盖单芯磁性、钢带、两芯及完整多芯领域映射；TB880大截面为特定参考验证，不构成任意结构认证。"
      ]
    },
